[Visual]izing concept: If you are studying something then[ it] will be fruitful to you when that remains in your memory so[ for] that[ pay an] extra attentions to pictures, diagrams, charts or graphics. You can also highlights the important things you need to remember with colorful pens draw charts or figures with your idea on your note books so that it will be easier for you to remember things.
